# Naming Rules

## Files

- kebab-case: `booking-draft.ts`, `route-prices.ts`
- React components: PascalCase file: `BookingForm.tsx`
- Test files: `<name>.test.ts` colocated with source

## Code

| Kind | Convention | Example |
|------|-----------|---------|
| Functions | camelCase | `calculatePrice` |
| Types/Interfaces | PascalCase | `PriceQuote` |
| Constants | SCREAMING_SNAKE | `DEFAULT_CURRENCY` |
| Enums (TS) | PascalCase type, SCREAMING values | `ReservationStatus = "PENDING"` |
| DB tables | snake_case | `route_prices` |
| DB columns | snake_case | `price_minor` |
| React components | PascalCase | `VehicleSelector` |

## Import paths

- Use `@/` alias for all internal imports
- Feature imports: `@/features/booking/server/service`

## Forbidden

- Abbreviations without context (`calc`, `mgr`, `tmp`)
- Single-letter variables (except loop indices)
- Hungarian notation
- Default exports for utilities
